  "crash_cause": "Null pointer dereference of ScoreTracker in AArenaGameMode::OnGoalScored (ArenaGameMode.cpp:38): ScoreTracker->AddPoints() crashes with EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION. ScoreTracker was a raw, non-UPROPERTY pointer, so it could be null or garbage-collected; the log shows the crash in UArenaScoreTracker::AddPoints called from OnGoalScored right after 'Goal for team 1'. Fixed by making ScoreTracker a UPROPERTY TObjectPtr so it is GC-tracked and validated before use.",
